# LeakSanitizer suppressions for the CI sanitizer job.
# Mesa's software Vulkan driver (lavapipe) keeps a one-time allocation per instance inside
# vkEnumeratePhysicalDevices (pthread_once in the driver). It is not Vexora's memory: every
# VkInstance we create is destroyed. Only frames inside the Vulkan loader are suppressed.
leak:libvulkan.so
